112	     * (e.g. {@code '+61412345678'} becomes {@code '+61 412 345 678'}). The known country codes are
113	     * {@code +61} (2 digits, matching the normalization in
114	     * {@link org.springframework.samples.petclinic.rest.function.owner.ValidateOwnerFields}) and
